A '''Mochibear''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Mochibears''' spawn in the {{zone|Tranquility Sanctum}} from early autumn to late winter.

== Behavior ==
'''Mochibears''' can be fed {{Item|Bamboo}} to grow in size. If the player feeds a '''Mochibear''' {{Item|Bamboo|amount=40-44}}, it will pass out and drop a {{Item|Mochibear Shard}}.

