== Bestiary ==
{{Bestiary Entry|section=Moonglade Marsh|lore=Its particularly thick fur causes it to frequently overheat, so it stays near water.|bracket=Hunting 2|max_tier=10|reward=Hunting}}

== Trivia ==
* Despite the game messages suggesting to push it, '''Mochibears''' ignore collision with players and therefore cannot be pushed.
** However, punching them causes them to flee from the player for a few blocks.

